packages/api/src/agent-rating-placebo.ts adapts the rating replay and the
shuffled-rating placebo method of backend/deskapp/simulate.py (functions
simulate in rating mode, metrics, ma_decisions, placebo and band).

Changes: translated from Python to TypeScript; rating mode only (the
trader-levels mode is not included); typed-array replay; placebo bands are
computed only at the charted points; random draws use a seeded mulberry32
stream; the agents percentile counts ties as half; placebo work is bounded
by bars times simulations.

packages/api/src/agent-model-benchmark.ts adapts the rating agreement
measures of results/local-models/README.md (ratings that match a baseline
run; distance to the closest baseline rating on the five-step scale) and the
exact two-sided sign test of backend/deskapp/paired.py.

Changes: written in TypeScript; an arm's modal rating stands for its reruns;
the sign test sums in log space; the paired test scores directional hits on a
5-day forward return instead of valuation statements.

services/vibe-trading/driver/vt_driver.py adapts backend/drivers/vt_driver.py
(the Vibe-Trading driver: environment set before Vibe-Trading loads, the
read-only tool allowlist with a tap on each tool object, the LLM callback,
the committee hooks around Vibe-Trading's swarm runtime and the prompts).

Changes: Vertex JSON-line event protocol with a 2000-character body preview
and a closing result line; a denylist guard on the allowlist and a check on
every tool call; the raw registry and each agent's granted tools are
reported for the adapter to check; only the endpoint's API key survives,
and git runs with a minimal environment; a clone with agent/.env is
refused; no tool output files; testable functions for the environment and
the committee member settings.

services/research/adapters/vibe_trading_framework.py adapts
backend/deskapp/vibe.py (the closing-block parse, the action mapping, the
"(omitted)" rule, the child environment and the not-point-in-time flag).

Changes: Vertex ports and types; an allowlisted child environment instead of
dropping known keys; a timeout and cancellation watch; its own filter of
the driver's raw tool registry and a check of each agent's granted tools;
the full-width omitted marker; price parsing; token
totals that also read the swarm's own count.

packages/api/src/agent-frameworks.ts adapts facts of the Vibe-Trading
reference sheet in backend/deskapp/frameworks.py.

Changes: rewritten as a typed TypeScript catalog with the Vertex wiring and
tool lists.

